docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:172:**Review modal → orphan-fill and incomplete-journal review.** "Is this merchant recurring? There are 9 more to review": entity card with recent transactions, a few form fields, and three actions (Skip / Not recurring / Save as recurring). Ours: "Is this fill part of a setup? N more to review", recent fills for the instrument, setup dropdown and planned stop, actions Skip / Not a trade / Save. The orange top banner with "Review now" is the pending-review entry point; the nav badge count (Recurring 10) is the proposals count on the rail.
docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:33:- Schwab account access is approved and the app is registered (status pending Ready For Use). Production host is a dokku app on GC2 at `desk.athayde.com`; callback is `https://desk.athayde.com/schwab/callback`; `SCHWAB_APP_KEY`, `SCHWAB_APP_SECRET`, and `SCHWAB_CALLBACK_URL` already exist as dokku config vars, so read exactly those names from ENV. Build the client against the schwab-py order-builder docs and community client libraries for response shapes; isolate every Schwab-shape assumption in the adapter layer so official schemas can replace them without touching callers. The live OAuth test waits on Ready For Use; everything else does not.
